<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch state ups tap price of 2007 bond to 101.00.</title>
<headline>Dutch state ups tap price of 2007 bond to 101.00.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry raised the price for tap sales of the government's new 5.75 percent bond due February 2007 to 101.00 from 100.85 on the second day of sales.</p>
<p>Tap sales will continue daily from 0800 GMT until further notice.</p>
</text>
